I agree. Reflection is not so important anymore, once you have
disintegration resistance (which will protect your armor as well, but
not your steed, I guess) and a good AC. On Astral, I regularly go
without reflection, since I prefer the amulet of life saving, in case
there is a guy with Vorpal Blade that may hit me before I notice he has
got the thing. Reflection is useful in the early game, magic resistance
important in the middle and late game (in the middle game it may, to
some extent, be replaced by a ring of polymorph control, but later that
will not protect you against the primary dangers anymore).


